    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, it doesn't feel like a gift. it feels like a mistake. when i see my family, i see how hard they try to be happy for me, but i can tell they're just performing. i feel like every breath i take is a breath someone else should have had. like i'm just a heavy weight dragging everyone down because i'm still here and they aren't. it's selfish, isn't it? just to keep existing?",
